 "MLOps is the <0>bookkeeping and plumbing</0> around training: which code, data and settings produced which model, and how to rerun or ship it.": "",
 "Without it, \"which run was the good one?\" ends up in filenames like <0/>.": "",
 "ClearML is one open-source platform covering tracking, data versioning, orchestration and serving; similar jobs are done by other tools.": "",
 "Even a small LoRA fine-tune benefits: many runs differ only by learning rate, rank or data version.": "",
