 "▼ Dive in: <0>Sweep table</0>": "",
 "Prompt templates, retrieval settings (chunk size, top-k) and eval scores are just <0>parameters and metrics</0>: log them like hyperparameters.": "",
 "Then \"which prompt + retrieval config scored best on our eval set?\" becomes a table sort.": "",
 "No weights change in RAG or prompt tuning, but results still depend on many knobs; tracking keeps them honest.": "",
 "MLflow, Weights & Biases and ClearML overlap a lot; differences below are broad generalisations, so verify against current docs.": "",
